[38;2;124;124;124mLet me think about this carefully. This is a question about the Schur multiplier[0m[38;2;124;124;124mand cohomology of finite simple groups.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mFirst, let me recall the relevant theory. For a finite group G and a trivial G-[0m
[38;2;124;124;124mmodule A, H^2(G, A) classifies central extensions of G by A. The Schur [0m
